---
interface Props { current: 'zhongqiu' | 'kongzi-birthday' }
const { current } = Astro.props;
---

<aside class="holiday-strip" aria-labelledby="holiday-strip-title">
  <p class="eyebrow">2026 九月日期</p>
  <h2 id="holiday-strip-title">中秋節與教師節共四天連假</h2>
  <ol>
    <li class:list={{ current: current === 'zhongqiu' }}>
      <time datetime="2026-09-25">9/25（五）</time>
      <a href="/festivals/zhongqiu/">中秋節</a>
    </li>
    <li><time datetime="2026-09-26">9/26（六）</time><span>週末</span></li>
    <li><time datetime="2026-09-27">9/27（日）</time><span>週末</span></li>
    <li class:list={{ current: current === 'kongzi-birthday' }}>
      <time datetime="2026-09-28">9/28（一）</time>
      <a href="/festivals/kongzi-birthday/">孔子誕辰紀念日／教師節</a>
    </li>
  </ol>
  <p class="muted small">四日連假日期依<a href="https://www.dgpa.gov.tw/information?pid=12574&uid=41" rel="nofollow">行政院人事行政總處 2026 年辦公日曆</a>；本區只整理日期，民俗內容分見兩頁。</p>
</aside>

<style>
  .holiday-strip { margin: 1.5rem 0; padding: 1rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 0.5rem; background: var(--paper-2); }
  .eyebrow { margin: 0; color: var(--gold); font-size: var(--text-xs); font-weight: 700; }
  h2 { margin: 0.2rem 0 0.75rem; padding: 0; border: 0; font-size: var(--text-lg); }
  ol { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 0.5rem; margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  li { display: flex; min-width: 0; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.2rem; padding: 0.65rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 0.4rem; background: var(--paper); }
  li.current { border-color: var(--accent); }
  time { color: var(--accent); font-size: var(--text-sm); font-weight: 700; }
  li a, li span { overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .small { margin-bottom: 0; }
  @media (max-width: 46rem) { ol { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); } }
</style>
